These are not open source software. Their terms of use and attribution
requirements are described in README.md.

- AirKorea air quality and station information, Korea Environment
  Corporation, via data.go.kr (KOGL Type 3)
- OpenWeather (openweathermap.org)
- Kakao Local API, Kakao Corp., via Kakao Developers (developers.kakao.com).
  AirFit is not affiliated with or endorsed by Kakao.
- Claude (Anthropic) on Amazon Bedrock, for clothing classification and the
  chat assistant. Turned off unless the LlmClassify or LlmChat deployment
  parameter is enabled.
